{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feather Land</strong> is an idle game designed for focus and mental tranquility, blending productivity tools with a study/work companion. By nurturing a variety of birds and building your own peaceful landscape, you can enjoy relaxing interactions and the company of your adorable feathered friends without interrupting your work. All that to the sound of nature and calming music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute bird companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different species of birds and establish emotional connections with them. Pet them, feed them, and watch them bring life to different biomes, from a lush forest to a desolate desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/6470f546f472dfdcf5d4d4611ebba9e7.poster.avif?t=1766350264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/6470f546f472dfdcf5d4d4611ebba9e7.webm?t=1766350264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/6470f546f472dfdcf5d4d4611ebba9e7.mp4?t=1766350264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus tools to enhance work efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use focus tools to allocate your time. The built-in Pomodoro timer and the to-do list will help you keep track of your tasks and manage them efficiently. Jot down your thoughts in the notebook to stay organized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/7547c9df7e45403d923472e68bc0e484.avif?t=1766350264\" width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing music and sounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing background music and natural environmental sounds, like birdsong and wind, create a calm atmosphere that perfectly fits your work or study space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/b9e33f610cf46055581dfba26b8363ad.avif?t=1766350264\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the space to your preferences. Choose your favorite birds, from common to rare to extinct. Adjust the weather and time of day, from a sunny morning to a rainy afternoon to a stormy night. Create the atmosphere that works best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/c34c45e8a444a983cb8056e47ad0cc2c.poster.avif?t=1766350264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/c34c45e8a444a983cb8056e47ad0cc2c.webm?t=1766350264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/c34c45e8a444a983cb8056e47ad0cc2c.mp4?t=1766350264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661430?t=1766350264","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661430?t=1766350264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/fafa3b27ef58e3c7a600f6138d647f04f4a66c01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766350264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/fafa3b27ef58e3c7a600f6138d647f04f4a66c01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766350264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feather Land</strong> is an idle game designed for focus and mental tranquility, blending productivity tools with a study/work companion. By nurturing a variety of birds and building your own peaceful landscape, you can enjoy relaxing interactions and the company of your adorable feathered friends without interrupting your work. All that to the sound of nature and calming music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute bird companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different species of birds and establish emotional connections with them. Pet them, feed them, and watch them bring life to different biomes, from a lush forest to a desolate desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/6470f546f472dfdcf5d4d4611ebba9e7.poster.avif?t=1766350264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/6470f546f472dfdcf5d4d4611ebba9e7.webm?t=1766350264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661430/extras/6470f546f472dfdcf5d4d4611ebba9e7.mp4?t=1766350264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus tools to enhance work efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragra